<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Revision of Sentence of Death and Imprisonment for Natural Life (Temporary Jurisdiction of the Federal Court) Act 2023."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
