<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of subsection 4(1), any person who is serving a sentence of imprisonment for natural life may make an application in writing to the Federal Court within ninety days from the date of coming into operation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon receiving an application under subsection (1), the Federal Court shall review the sentence of imprisonment of natural life."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Federal Court may extend the time specified under subsection (1) if it considers that there is a good reason for doing so."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any application under subsection (1) may only be made once by the person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/8/eng@> .
